  (text "1. MCU & BLE CONTROLLER\nU1: STM32WB55RGVx (VFQFPN-68)\n- PA8 (TIM1_CH1): DINP (2MHz, 0 deg)\n- PB13 (TIM1_CH1N): DINN (2MHz, 180 deg)\n- PC0, PC1 (GPIO): SEL0, SEL1 (MUX Select)\n- PA0 (TIM2_CH1 + DMA): COMP_OUT_TIM_IC\n- VDD = +3.3V, VSS = GND"
    (at 30.48 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left))
  )
  (text "2. TRANSMIT MULTIPLEXER\nU2: DG409CUE+ (TSSOP-16 Dual 4:1 MUX)\n- S1A..S4A -> MAX14808 DINP1..DINP4\n- S1B..S4B -> MAX14808 DINN1..DINN4\n- DA <- DINP, DB <- DINN\n- A0 <- SEL0, A1 <- SEL1, EN = +3.3V\n- V+ = +5V, V- = -5V, GND = 0V"
    (at 115.0 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left))
  )
  (text "3. HIGH-VOLTAGE PULSER & T/R SWITCH\nU3: MAX14808ETK+ (TQFN-68)\n- DINP1..4, DINN1..4 <- From DG409\n- OUT1..OUT4 -> To J1 (4x PZT Transducers, +/-20V Bipolar)\n- LVOUT1..LVOUT4 -> To DG408 Rx MUX (Internal T/R Switch)\n- VPP_A/B = +20V, VNN_A/B = -20V\n- VDD = +3.3V, VCC = +5V, VEE = -5V"
    (at 205.0 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left))
  )
  (text "4. RECEIVE MULTIPLEXER\nU4: DG408CUE+ (TSSOP-16 Single 8:1 MUX)\n- S1..S4 <- MAX14808 LVOUT1..LVOUT4\n- D (Pin 8) -> MUX_RX_OUT (To OPA357)\n- A0 <- SEL0, A1 <- SEL1, A2 = GND\n- V+ = +5V, V- = -5V"
    (at 30.48 115.0 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left))
  )
  (text "5. AMPLIFIER & 5.88 MHz LOW-PASS FILTER\nU5: OPA357AIDBVT (SOT-23-6, 100 MHz GBW)\n- Gain = 10: R1 = 1 kOhm, R2 = 10 kOhm\n- Passive RC LPF (fc = 5.88 MHz):\n  R3 = 270 Ohm, C1 = 100 pF (C0G/NP0)\n- Supply: V+ = +5V, V- = -5V"
    (at 115.0 115.0 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left))
  )
  (text "6. 1-BIT ADC HYSTERESIS COMPARATOR\nU6: MAX941CSA+ (SOIC-8)\n- IN- <- LPF_OUT (Filtered Echo Signal)\n- IN+ <- Hysteresis Reference Network:\n  R4 = 20 kOhm (to +5V), R5 = 20 kOhm (to GND),\n  R6 = 60 kOhm (Feedback from OUT to IN+)\n- OUT -> COMP_OUT_TIM_IC (To STM32 PA0 Timer Capture)"
    (at 205.0 115.0 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left))
  )
  (text "7. POWER MANAGEMENT SUBSYSTEM (PMIC)\nInput: J2 (3.7V LiPo Battery, 150 mAh)\n- U7 (LT3463 / TPS65131): Generates +20V and -20V HV Pulser Rails\n- U8 (LM27762): Generates low-noise +5V and -5V Analog Rails\n- U9 (TLV75533): Generates +3.3V MCU & Logic Rail\n- U10 (TLV75525): Generates +2.5V Reference Rail"
    (at 30.48 180.0 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left))
  )

